Revised and reran the deliverables.

- Corrected untrimmed stratification: all 15,992 CPS controls are now eligible; rich-score no-trim stratification is −$180.7, not $1,252.5.
- Replaced NN SEs with explicitly labeled fixed-weight HC intervals and added dependent-gap intervals.
- Added max post-adjustment |SMD|, treated retained, and effective control sample size.
- Revised trimming and recovery language: all rows retain 185 treated units; favorable results are limited to richer 1-NN specifications and do not establish equivalence.

